I hope everyone's okay.

251
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,350
Kaiba!

252
00:18:58,900 --> 00:18:59,960
Oh, great.

253
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:03,880
If it isn't the dweeb patrol.

254
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:05,820
What happened up there?

255
00:19:06,340 --> 00:19:07,170
Roll it!

256
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:12,060
So you dueled this guy
on top of a moving plane?

257
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,360
Maybe I did.

258
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:16,217
Don't you geeks have
someone else to annoy?

259
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:19,177
Kaiba, we can't do this
without you, and you know it.

260
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:23,660
So please, accept your destiny
and help us to stop this evil.

261
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:29,620
If I had a dime for every time you used
the word destiny, I'd be even richer.

262
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:34,080
Mr. Kaiba! Mokuba! Are you hurt?

263
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:36,080
We're fine. Good.

264
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:38,400
But I've got terrible news.

265
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:49,800
Master Darts, I've just received word
from our business division. Yes? Go on.

266
00:19:50,620 --> 00:19:52,097
The takeover was a success.

267
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:53,577
Congratulations, Master.

268
00:19:53,660 --> 00:19:55,820
Kaiba Corp now belongs to you.
